WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:13.110
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Episode 3</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Earth, Fairy-playah?</b>

01:44.870 --> 01:48.450
Lately, fairies have been so friendly
 toward me for some reason.

01:51.880 --> 01:55.080
Sorry, but I can't make a contract with you.

01:55.080 --> 01:57.070
My crystal's broken.

02:01.110 --> 02:02.470
Are you playing?

02:02.800 --> 02:05.260
Well, as long as you're having fun.

02:05.890 --> 02:08.270
<b>Skill List
Archery: Lv.18
Kick: Lv.47
Long-Distance Vision: Lv.31
Wind Magic: Lv.32
Production Fingertips: Lv.39
Cooking: Lv.40
Concealment: Lv.27
Improved Physical Abilities: Lv. 50
Theft: Lv.10
Whip: Lv.12
EXP: 13

Unequipped Skills
Blacksmith Lv.20</b>

02:06.580 --> 02:08.840
<i>My skill levels have gone up!</i>

02:08.270 --> 02:10.310
<b>Specialize
This will cost 3 EXP.
Are you sure?</b>

02:08.840 --> 02:09.970
<i>That means...</i>

02:10.310 --> 02:11.430
<i>All right.</i>

02:11.430 --> 02:13.740
<i>I can learn a more specialized skill!</i>

02:18.400 --> 02:23.200
<i>If I can master new skills, 
I'll be able to fight in whole new ways!</i>

02:29.240 --> 02:33.040
Time for my first dungeon trip!

02:44.820 --> 02:50.300
<i>I remember exploring caves
like this when I was young.</i>

02:51.980 --> 02:54.650
<b>Threat Detected</b>

02:54.640 --> 02:56.440
<i>That was close.</i>

02:59.990 --> 03:04.970
<i>I was still a kid, and it
was so exciting to me.</i>

03:04.970 --> 03:09.540
<i>That feeling of not knowing 
how far the darkness would go...</i>

03:09.990 --> 03:13.920
<i>I thought I could never
experience that again!</i>

03:26.970 --> 03:31.350
<i>But this really is a world
filled with adventure!</i>

03:32.960 --> 03:35.630
Veni Gutadia Acrus Ratula!

03:35.560 --> 03:36.270
<b>Wind Cutter</b>

03:35.630 --> 03:37.220
Wind Cutter!

03:43.480 --> 03:44.540
What?

03:47.670 --> 03:50.030
I'll use the High Jump
skill I just learned!

03:51.120 --> 03:52.290
<b>High Jump</b>

03:54.830 --> 03:55.860
Ow...

03:57.210 --> 03:58.290
Take this!

04:04.250 --> 04:05.610
Ow...

04:05.610 --> 04:08.380
I'll have to watch out for ceilings, I guess.

04:13.100 --> 04:15.480
Are those darkness fairies?

04:17.710 --> 04:20.000
They want me to follow them?

04:32.870 --> 04:35.510
I wouldn't have been able
to pass this way before,

04:35.510 --> 04:38.130
but now I have Stable Center of Gravity.

04:37.460 --> 04:39.130
<b>Stable Center of Gravity
Stabilizes one's sense of balance. Also allows standing in swamps
and other areas with bad footing, minimizing the penalties for poor terrain.</b>

04:45.460 --> 04:47.760
There are so many fairies.

04:48.110 --> 04:50.430
Is there something there?

04:53.340 --> 04:54.650
What is this?

04:57.800 --> 04:59.450
A secret door?

05:04.390 --> 05:07.040
This is what makes adventuring great!

05:07.040 --> 05:08.530
Any traps?

05:08.960 --> 05:10.190
Nope!

05:12.980 --> 05:15.060
An old ring...

05:15.060 --> 05:17.670
Or maybe you're supposed
to put something on it?

05:18.560 --> 05:21.140
I'll take it as a memory of my adventures.

05:22.600 --> 05:26.190
Thanks to you guys, I've found a neat item!

05:26.190 --> 05:27.370
Thank you!

05:30.850 --> 05:32.910
A message from the GMs?

05:33.760 --> 05:39.200
"We're ready to announce the
second half of The Fairy Ball."

05:39.200 --> 05:43.360
"Its name is 'The Fairy Battle Tournament!'"

05:44.000 --> 05:47.260
So they're finally announcing
the second half of the event?

05:54.240 --> 05:56.210
<b>One More Free Life Online
New Update Information</b>

05:54.240 --> 05:56.890
<i>Your fairies are about to evolve!</i>

05:56.210 --> 05:57.670
<b>New Special PvP Mode!</b>

05:57.790 --> 06:02.000
<b>New Special PvP Mode!</b>

05:58.520 --> 06:03.680
<i>By participating in, or winning,
a certain number of PvP fights,</i>

06:04.120 --> 06:07.630
<i>your fairies will evolve
and take a new form!</i>

06:08.930 --> 06:17.350
<b>You've been challenged
to a special PVP battle.
Do you accept?</b>

06:09.190 --> 06:12.890
<i>You won't be able to evolve them by fighting
the same opponents over and over again.</i>

06:12.890 --> 06:15.850
<i>Try to fight a lot of different opponents!</i>

06:17.360 --> 06:22.990
<i>The top 16 players in this special PvP
mode will be invited to a tournament.</i>

06:22.990 --> 06:24.920
<i>Expect some amazing prizes for the winners!</i>

06:25.880 --> 06:28.790
<i>There's a ton more coming
in this update, too!</i>

06:27.740 --> 06:29.200
<b>New Titles Added</b>

06:29.320 --> 06:33.240
Fairy's Neighbor

06:29.660 --> 06:33.240
<i>Get a title that separates
you from the rest!</i>

06:33.240 --> 06:38.160
Fairy's Neighbor

06:33.860 --> 06:37.830
<i>There are also hidden titles that you
can earn based on your playstyle!</i>

06:38.290 --> 06:41.710
<b>Second Contract with Fairies</b>

06:38.660 --> 06:44.400
<i>And those who failed to make
contracts with fairies at first</i>

06:44.400 --> 06:47.980
<i>can repair their contract crystals via PvP!</i>

06:47.980 --> 06:51.530
<i>Repaired contract crystals
have a guaranteed success rate</i>

06:51.530 --> 06:54.040
<i>and a higher likelihood of rare fairies!</i>

06:54.390 --> 06:57.060
<b>Self-Identity Unlock</b>

06:55.060 --> 07:01.080
<i>Fairy self-identity has also been unlocked,
and fairies will act differently than before!</i>

07:01.900 --> 07:06.450
<i>Our latest update, "The Fairy Battle
Tournament," is coming soon!</i>

07:06.450 --> 07:08.390
<i>See the site for more details!</i>

07:13.250 --> 07:16.970
Wow, everybody's really excited.

07:16.970 --> 07:19.250
So am I, but...

07:20.000 --> 07:24.410
Will this work, though? There are a
lot of people who aren't good at PvP.

07:24.990 --> 07:30.470
I hope people don't start targeting
craftspeople who aren't good at combat.

07:33.250 --> 07:36.010
Oh, you don't need to worry
about problems with PvP.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.690
Yeah?

07:37.690 --> 07:38.920
Yup!

07:38.920 --> 07:43.130
We craftspeople have all agreed that
 if anybody tries to force one of us to fight,

07:43.130 --> 07:47.190
we'll tell each other about it.

07:47.190 --> 07:49.670
Nobody's stupid enough to try something

07:49.670 --> 07:53.120
if it means making an enemy
out of the entire guild.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.670
I see.

07:54.670 --> 07:56.040
I'm glad to hear that.

07:56.370 --> 07:59.720
Oh, have you gone to the new town yet?

07:59.720 --> 08:02.950
The one that was just discovered?

08:03.390 --> 08:05.240
I think the name was...

08:05.760 --> 08:07.720
The town of Nexia.

08:07.720 --> 08:08.720
Yeah.

08:08.720 --> 08:13.250
They've opened the warp portal,
so it's easy to get there.

08:13.640 --> 08:18.900
That's where the hardcore 
PvP crowd is gathering.

08:19.310 --> 08:25.810
People who want to take their time are
all meeting up to fight around First.

08:26.100 --> 08:28.470
So they're splitting into groups?

08:28.470 --> 08:33.590
Players making decisions like that is one
of the neat things about online games.

08:34.030 --> 08:37.180
Blacks, are you going to fight in First?

08:37.480 --> 08:38.450
Nope.

08:40.870 --> 08:44.210
I'm happier just swinging my hammer.

08:44.210 --> 08:46.920
I'll let the other players do the fighting.

08:47.890 --> 08:49.950
A true craftsperson!

08:49.950 --> 08:52.620
<i>There are lots of ways
you can enjoy an event.</i>

08:52.620 --> 08:54.600
<i>What should I do?</i>

09:01.080 --> 09:04.170
I spent a lot of time waiting to log in.

09:04.170 --> 09:06.350
I guess that's what happens on patch day.

09:06.350 --> 09:09.520
Now, I think they said
they're adding titles...

09:09.520 --> 09:11.270
Hey, look at that!

09:11.270 --> 09:13.700
That's definitely one! That's a rare title!

09:14.490 --> 09:18.330
I guess I'll see what my title is.

09:19.950 --> 09:24.830
<b>Title: Fairy-playah
A title given to those beloved by the fairies.
This title cannot be unequipped.
To remove it, fight 1 special PvP battle
during this event.</b>

09:25.640 --> 09:27.120
What?

09:27.750 --> 09:31.090
Fairy-playah

09:28.040 --> 09:31.070
He's a Fairy-playah?

09:34.010 --> 09:36.220
What the hell is this?

09:36.220 --> 09:40.600
And every other player can
see it? That's humiliating!

09:43.350 --> 09:46.680
This title stands out a little too much.

09:48.170 --> 09:51.310
That's right.
 If I do a PvP, it'll disappear!

09:51.310 --> 09:55.890
Would somebody please fight me?

09:57.740 --> 09:59.350
Sure, I will!

10:00.450 --> 10:07.250
<b>Rona has challenged you
to a special PvP duel.
Do you accept?</b>

10:03.810 --> 10:07.260
Thank you for your help!
You're making me cry!

10:07.260 --> 10:09.370
No, it's fine.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.950
I'm Rona.

10:11.950 --> 10:14.010
You're Earth, right?

10:15.720 --> 10:17.300
You know me?

10:17.300 --> 10:18.430
Yeah.

10:18.430 --> 10:20.230
I'm a member of Blue Color.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.150
Blue Color?

10:26.270 --> 10:28.440
You're in Zwei's guild?

10:28.440 --> 10:32.680
That's right. I use a lot of martial arts,

10:32.680 --> 10:37.420
so I've been wanting to meet you,
 since you use kicks!

10:37.420 --> 10:38.930
I see!

10:39.320 --> 10:43.240
Anyway, thanks so much for PvPing me!

10:46.320 --> 10:47.240
What?

10:49.010 --> 10:51.170
You want to tell me something?

10:51.500 --> 10:53.110
What's gotten into him?

10:53.110 --> 10:56.540
He's usually pretty shy.

11:01.090 --> 11:03.510
Fairy-playah

11:02.470 --> 11:03.500
What?

11:04.010 --> 11:06.160
You mean you don't want to fight?

11:06.160 --> 11:10.430
He's never let me know what
he's thinking like that!

11:13.110 --> 11:20.280
Fairy-playah

11:13.360 --> 11:16.150
Look! He really is a Fairy-playah!

11:16.150 --> 11:18.280
The title doesn't lie!

11:18.280 --> 11:20.280
N-N-No! This is...!

11:20.280 --> 11:23.950
Somebody PvP me!

11:23.950 --> 11:31.330
<b>Asking for PvP
Please Wait</b>

11:27.930 --> 11:30.870
It always went the same way.

11:31.700 --> 11:36.470
Could I really force a fairy to
fight if they didn't want to?

11:36.720 --> 11:38.730
No, I couldn't.

11:37.460 --> 11:39.380
<b>Gloom</b>

11:39.380 --> 11:43.550
Fairy-playah

11:39.620 --> 11:43.550
I've never seen anyone actually do that.

11:43.550 --> 11:46.360
<i>I'm so mad at you, GMs!</i>

11:52.860 --> 11:55.680
<i>Earth, are you busy?</i>

11:55.680 --> 11:57.940
No, I can talk.

11:57.940 --> 11:59.310
<i>Thanks.</i>

11:59.310 --> 12:01.910
<i>I actually need some advice.</i>

12:02.220 --> 12:05.920
<i>You're having problems because 
your fairy won't eat anything, right?</i>

12:05.920 --> 12:08.240
Yeah, how'd you know?

12:08.240 --> 12:13.490
I guessed. You want me to
 make food he'll eat, right?

12:13.490 --> 12:16.250
<i>Wow! How'd you know?</i>

12:16.640 --> 12:18.010
Well...

12:18.470 --> 12:23.920
Because half the server is asking for
the same thing right this minute!

12:23.920 --> 12:26.740
<i>H-How did that happen?</i>

12:26.740 --> 12:28.610
Actually...

12:29.360 --> 12:31.550
Fairy food?

12:31.550 --> 12:36.910
Yes. Up until now, I've been feeding
mine the bread the NPCs sell, but...

12:39.440 --> 12:41.290
But now this happens.

12:41.290 --> 12:43.420
That bread's not very good, yeah.

12:43.420 --> 12:47.220
So I figured that you, 
the man who made that steak,

12:45.410 --> 12:52.040
Amazing Steak Guy

12:47.220 --> 12:50.630
would be able to make something he'd like!

12:52.350 --> 12:55.660
Well, since you were nice enough to ask...

12:55.660 --> 12:58.780
It wouldn't be right of
me as a chef to say no!

12:58.780 --> 13:00.660
Thanks!

13:00.660 --> 13:03.140
I'm so glad I asked you!

13:03.100 --> 13:09.850
So I made a big thing of karaage
I thought the fairy would like.

13:03.900 --> 13:06.370
I'm so happy! Thank you!

13:09.850 --> 13:11.690
I'll take five packs of karaage!

13:11.690 --> 13:13.180
Eight packs, here!

13:14.200 --> 13:18.560
I'm sorry! Limit of three per person!

13:18.560 --> 13:20.960
Everybody found out about it,

13:20.960 --> 13:24.100
and the next thing I knew,
I was cooking for the whole town!

13:24.780 --> 13:26.740
I don't want to stand out!

13:26.740 --> 13:28.620
Why did this happen to me?

13:32.230 --> 13:35.640
Sorry to make you help.

13:35.640 --> 13:37.540
Aw, don't say that.

13:37.540 --> 13:39.780
You made some for me.

13:40.050 --> 13:42.830
I'm the one who should thank you.

13:42.830 --> 13:45.470
Thanks to you, things have calmed down.

13:45.870 --> 13:50.910
And more craftspeople
 are making fairy food.

13:51.370 --> 13:53.320
I suppose it's time to close up shop.

13:53.570 --> 13:54.880
I see.

13:54.880 --> 13:56.820
What will you do now?

13:56.820 --> 13:59.180
Hm...

13:59.180 --> 14:05.440
I've been cooking the whole time, so I haven't 
had a chance to check out the new patch.

14:05.870 --> 14:10.610
Then why don't you come see
the new town with me?

14:16.970 --> 14:19.430
So this is Nexia?

14:20.250 --> 14:21.830
Look over there!

14:22.230 --> 14:24.080
They're doing PvP!

14:26.260 --> 14:28.430
Fairy-playah

14:33.260 --> 14:34.860
Let's do this.

14:34.860 --> 14:36.550
I know we can win!

14:39.550 --> 14:41.060
Hey, Earth...

14:41.060 --> 14:44.900
Isn't there something weird
about that wolf fairy?

14:44.900 --> 14:46.460
You're right.

14:47.350 --> 14:48.860
Make a windstorm!

14:51.370 --> 14:53.800
He blocked it? But...

14:58.020 --> 14:59.220
He's good!

14:59.220 --> 15:03.080
The way he's blocking those blows...
He's not having the system do it for him!

15:04.930 --> 15:06.150
Now!

15:06.150 --> 15:08.320
Get him with fire magic!

15:09.220 --> 15:11.130
Hey, what are you doing?

15:11.130 --> 15:12.420
Hurry up!

15:14.430 --> 15:16.300
Not again!

15:16.570 --> 15:18.070
What's going on?

15:18.070 --> 15:20.600
The fairy ignored his command?

15:24.800 --> 15:25.890
Now!

15:30.810 --> 15:33.730
Thanks. We won, thanks to you!

15:33.730 --> 15:35.860
So that's it.

15:35.860 --> 15:39.320
Hey, Earth, what just happened?

15:39.320 --> 15:42.750
A fairy can't just ignore its
master's commands, right?

15:42.750 --> 15:45.680
He's a slave fairy user.

15:45.680 --> 15:46.750
What's that?

15:47.130 --> 15:51.950
That's what they call people
who abuse their fairies.

15:52.700 --> 15:57.200
If you hit your fairy to
make it do what you want,

15:57.200 --> 16:01.050
or don't treat it kindly, I guess sometimes
it'll stop listening. Like that.

16:01.050 --> 16:02.310
I see.

16:02.790 --> 16:06.020
Well, it's hard to say
he doesn't deserve it.

16:06.450 --> 16:10.190
D-Damn it! You didn't do what I told you!

16:10.500 --> 16:14.050
Oh, no! Something really
bad's about to happen?

16:14.050 --> 16:16.040
Wh-What do you mean?

16:16.560 --> 16:22.070
I once saw a video of a slave
fairy user on a video site once.

16:22.420 --> 16:24.880
If you abuse a fairy too much...

16:25.360 --> 16:29.200
<i>Why didn't you protect me back there?</i>

16:29.200 --> 16:31.130
<i>You're just a tool, right?</i>

16:31.130 --> 16:32.550
<i>Screw you!</i>

16:33.630 --> 16:36.990
<i>You're worthless! Just disappear!</i>

16:38.760 --> 16:42.990
And as a penalty, you have to fight
a battle with your contracted fairy.

16:42.990 --> 16:45.020
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

16:51.670 --> 16:53.840
<i>What are you going to do?</i>

16:53.840 --> 16:55.750
<i>I'm your master!</i>

16:57.150 --> 16:58.650
<i>Stop it! Stop!</i>

17:01.560 --> 17:05.600
If you lose the battle,
they take your contract crystal,

17:06.230 --> 17:09.530
and all your fairy-related data is reset.

17:11.270 --> 17:12.570
Damn it.

17:18.920 --> 17:22.470
I guess he knew that.

17:22.470 --> 17:25.990
I didn't know that there
was a system like that.

17:26.490 --> 17:31.360
There used to be systems like that in
old online games, once in a while.

17:31.360 --> 17:33.830
If you gave too many unreasonable orders,

17:33.830 --> 17:35.560
they'd suddenly go out of control,

17:35.560 --> 17:37.910
or attack you.

17:37.910 --> 17:40.600
It's hard to think of anybody
making something like that today.

17:40.870 --> 17:45.080
Most games these days go
easier on their players.

17:45.560 --> 17:50.640
Maybe the GMs are trying to make
it feel like an old-school MMO.

17:51.080 --> 17:52.700
I see.

17:52.700 --> 17:56.840
Anyway, I'm kind of tired,
so I'm gonna log off for the day.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.160
Bye!

17:58.160 --> 18:00.760
Okay, thanks for the karaage.

18:00.760 --> 18:03.390
I'll share them with my fairy later.

18:13.430 --> 18:17.470
<i>Some people, like Rona,
really care about their fairies.</i>

18:17.470 --> 18:19.370
<i>And some don't.</i>

18:21.120 --> 18:24.380
<i>I guess it's up to the player
what they want to do.</i>

18:33.500 --> 18:38.220
Fairy-playah

18:36.260 --> 18:37.450
Excuse me.

18:40.900 --> 18:42.850
Can I talk to you?

18:43.420 --> 18:45.680
I saw you the other day...

18:46.020 --> 18:51.400
Fairy-playah

18:46.970 --> 18:51.390
I wanted to talk to you,
because you've got that title!

18:51.400 --> 18:53.020
<b>Don't mention</b>

18:51.400 --> 18:53.020
<b>the title!</b>

18:52.610 --> 18:54.900
Fairy-playah

18:55.540 --> 18:59.820
You want to know how to 
make up with your fairy, huh?

19:00.160 --> 19:05.110
Yeah, I saw the video where
somebody's fairy attacked them.

19:05.110 --> 19:07.840
And if I don't do something,
I'll end up like that!

19:07.840 --> 19:11.550
Why were you so mean to
him in the first place?

19:11.890 --> 19:14.420
I didn't know what I was supposed to do,

19:14.420 --> 19:17.010
so I looked at the videos
other players were uploading.

19:17.690 --> 19:22.920
They were all treating their
fairies like circus animals.

19:23.760 --> 19:26.670
I thought that was what
you were supposed to do.

19:26.670 --> 19:30.250
And they got a personality
during the update,

19:30.250 --> 19:33.100
and your fairy stopped listening to you?

19:33.100 --> 19:34.130
Yeah.

19:34.700 --> 19:40.300
And after that, I hit it a few
times to make it obey me...

19:40.750 --> 19:44.320
I knew I shouldn't have been doing it.

19:44.890 --> 19:48.750
So you don't know how to treat
your fairy, is that it?

19:48.750 --> 19:52.260
Please! Give me some advice! Anything!

19:52.260 --> 19:53.110
I'll pay—

19:53.110 --> 19:54.680
I don't need money!

19:54.680 --> 19:57.750
And don't try to solve
it that way, either.

19:57.750 --> 19:58.960
It'll turn into a habit.

19:58.960 --> 20:01.000
Oh, sorry.

20:01.000 --> 20:02.780
I'll give you advice.

20:02.780 --> 20:05.480
It's up to you whether to
follow it or not, though.

20:05.790 --> 20:08.630
Thank you. What do I do?

20:08.630 --> 20:14.310
You don't need to do anything special.
Just treat it as a friend.

20:14.740 --> 20:15.900
A friend?

20:16.450 --> 20:18.090
Fight together.

20:18.090 --> 20:19.950
Take breaks with it.

20:19.950 --> 20:22.250
And when you finish adventuring
and head back to town,

20:22.250 --> 20:24.670
say "bye" before you log out.

20:25.330 --> 20:29.970
Take care of your fairy,
and he'll sense it.

20:31.380 --> 20:34.010
You could try sharing a meal with him, too!

20:34.010 --> 20:35.240
A meal?

20:36.280 --> 20:40.880
Hey, you're the Fairy-playah Chef, right?

20:41.650 --> 20:43.580
Don't call me that!

20:44.340 --> 20:45.520
And?

20:46.520 --> 20:49.420
I'd like you to make something
that'll make it happy.

20:51.220 --> 20:53.850
Got it!

20:59.150 --> 21:02.560
One order of Rabbithorn karaage!

21:01.900 --> 21:03.610
<b>Score : 8</b>

21:32.640 --> 21:33.990
That's all it takes!

21:33.990 --> 21:37.810
Be careful, and little by little,
you'll be able to make up with it!

21:37.810 --> 21:40.540
Yeah... Thank you!

21:42.180 --> 21:44.990
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry.

21:42.320 --> 21:45.400
<b>Fairy-playah</b>

21:46.190 --> 21:47.800
I'll come back if I need anything!

21:49.840 --> 21:51.650
I'm glad it worked out.

21:51.650 --> 21:53.120
Wonderful.

21:53.610 --> 21:54.490
Who's there?

21:55.910 --> 21:59.070
My name is Silver.

22:00.500 --> 22:02.610
We need to talk.

22:02.610 --> 22:06.300
Could you come with me someplace where
there aren't many people around?

22:07.430 --> 22:09.930
<b>To be continued</b>
